### ==============================================================================
### The Data Storm - API Request Test File (REST Client / Thunder Client)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@userId = 6ab67220547af7bd57a0ef2e
@postId = 6ab67247547af7bd57a0ef2f

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Create User (Author)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abhishek Sharma",
  "email": "abhishek.dev@example.com"
}

### 3. Get All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Create Post (Referencing Author)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Mastering MongoDB Atlas & Mongoose",
  "content": "Live database persistence with strict schemas and relational population.",
  "authorId": "{{userId}}"
}

### 5. Get All Posts (With Populated Author)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Get Top 3 Most Recent Posts (Phase 3 Aggregation / Sorting)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/recent
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Delete Post by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
